    {
      "chunk": {
        "chunk_id": "care_supreme-0044",
        "doc_id": "care_supreme",
        "text": "A Claim will be admissible under the Recharge only if the Claim is a d m i s s i b l e u n d e r B e n e f i t 'Hospitalization Expenses'. Recharge amount can be utilized for same illness as well as different Illnesses. The Sum Insured available under this Benefit can only be utilized for Benefits – 'Hospitalization Expenses' and 'Road Ambulance Cover'. All Insured Persons will be eligible to utilize the Recharged amount for any illness or injury pertaining to that Policy Year. Applicable 'Cumulative Bonus ' ,'Optional Benefit: Cumulative Bonus Super' , Optional Benefit: Plus Benefit shall not be considered while calculating 'Unlimited Automatic Recharge'.",
        "section_path": "3.1 BASE BENEFITS > 3.1.4 Benefit : Unlimited Automatic Recharge > (ii)",
        "page": 12
      },
      "score": 1.0991088151931763,
      "bm25_rank": 2,
      "dense_rank": 3
    },
    {
      "chunk": {
        "chunk_id": "care_supreme-0042",
        "doc_id": "care_supreme",
        "text": "In the event of a Claim there is no impact on the accrual of Cumulative Bonus. In case Sum Insured under the Policy is reduced at the time of renewal, the applicable Cumulative Bonus shall be reduced in proportion to the Sum Insured. In case Sum Insured under the Policy is increased at the time of renewal, the Cumulative Bonus shall be calculated on the Sum Insured applicable on the last completed Policy Year. The 'Unlimited Automatic Recharge' and Optional Benefit: 'Plus Benefit' amount shall not be considered while calculating 'Cumulative Bonus'. Accrued 'Cumulative Bonus' can be utilized for Base Benefits- 'Hospitalization Expenses', ' Road Ambulance Cover' under the Policy.",
